#: ../../developer-api/scopes.md:1 93c5c44f2d8540a5a4d461f6dbbbdc63
msgid "Scopes"
msgstr "作用域"

#: ../../developer-api/scopes.md:3 90e8dac0b1614e3c91ca6a692347e8a9
msgid ""
"Each API key carries granular scopes; an endpoint accepts a key only if "
"its scopes satisfy the endpoint's requirement."
msgstr "每个 API 密钥都携带细粒度的作用域；只有当密钥的作用域满足端点的要求时，该端点才会接受这个密钥。"

#: ../../developer-api/scopes.md:5 e2ee49bf6db547558192776a4d6544cf
msgid ""
"Scopes are `<action>:<resource>` — `read:profile`, `write:posts`, "
"`manage:webhooks`. `read` scopes are non-mutating; `write` and `manage` "
"change state."
msgstr ""
"作用域的格式为 `<action>:<resource>`，例如 "
"`read:profile`、`write:posts`、`manage:webhooks`。`read` 作用域不会修改状态；`write` 和"
" `manage` 会改变状态。"

#: ../../developer-api/scopes.md:7 8d9af5244869482fbec8789f32830a1b
msgid "Three wildcards are accepted and stored literally on the key:"
msgstr "密钥支持以下三种通配符，并会按原样存储在密钥中："

#: ../../developer-api/scopes.md 0602e84c9af34b6b9e7a5f9607d7c8ed
msgid "Wildcard"
msgstr "通配符"

#: ../../developer-api/scopes.md 0c20c1f45ecb4cdab6c31af1b8be391c
#: af2cfcfa2b6b45b08b93398a0b8be723
msgid "Grants"
msgstr "授予权限"

#: ../../developer-api/scopes.md 2690d01c63334f10b795ac69783b9cb6
msgid "`*`"
msgstr "`*`"

#: ../../developer-api/scopes.md 641dc427e09f414d95c2779d56f0b175
msgid "Everything."
msgstr "所有权限。"

#: ../../developer-api/scopes.md d5f467706d944218b79436d711b2306b
msgid "`read:*`"
msgstr "`read:*`"

#: ../../developer-api/scopes.md c81600c798b0483cb6dbfb6a92fcb72f
msgid "Every read scope."
msgstr "所有 read 作用域。"

#: ../../developer-api/scopes.md 12c8b970840c4e5eb403b97d48c50796
msgid "`write:*`"
msgstr "`write:*`"

#: ../../developer-api/scopes.md a062a673df8d4da9a20f03cf3b64a780
msgid "Every write scope (likewise `manage:*`)."
msgstr "所有 write 作用域（`manage:*` 同理）。"

#: ../../developer-api/scopes.md:15 16d65a2b5ff64822850b5d3a89f4f4dd
msgid ""
"Grant the least privilege an integration needs. A key that only reads the"
" public feed should carry `read:feed` and nothing else — if it leaks, "
"that is the whole blast radius."
msgstr ""
"只授予某个集成所需的最小权限。如果一个密钥只需要读取公开动态流，就应该只携带 "
"`read:feed`，不要携带其他作用域——这样即使密钥泄露，影响范围也仅限于此。"

#: ../../developer-api/scopes.md:17 0dafd726904b412a865a576545018af6
msgid ""
"A request whose key lacks the required scope fails with `403 "
"insufficient_scope`; the message names the scope that was missing."
msgstr "如果请求所用的密钥缺少所需作用域，会返回 `403 insufficient_scope` 错误；错误消息中会指明缺失的具体作用域。"

